{
  "rationale": "The plant models the robot's perception and actuation capabilities, separating sensing and motion. The specification binds sensor outcomes to safe, progress-oriented actions, enforcing conservative obstacle recovery, brief backward escapes, and last-resort full rotation only when stuck. The design prioritizes forward exploration and avoids repeated or oscillatory recovery actions.",
  "strategy": [
    "Separate plant automata for perception (sensors) and motion (actuators) to allow modular specification.",
    "Specification automata bind sensor outcomes to safe actions, enforce conservative recovery, and ensure steady exploration progress, using helper states for recovery and stuck handling."
